--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/+monkeypatch-inherited-attr.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+:meth:`MonkeyPatch.setattr <pytest.MonkeyPatch.setattr>` no longer leaves a new entry in the instance ``__dict__`` after undo when patching an inherited attribute of a non-class object -- previously this could freeze the result of a ``__get__`` descriptor.
